{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115660","id":3229773170,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Agm1y","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115660","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115660.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115660.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115660","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115660/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115660/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115660/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/199dc98c2a4d8ac459ffeeb47da757ab39585185","number":115660,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `simplify_path()` mangling paths with uri schemes containing non-alphanumeric characters","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\n[The RFC spec for URI](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-3.1) states that the URI scheme should be of the pattern:\r\n```\r\nscheme = ALPHA *( ALPHA / DIGIT / \"+\" / \"-\" / \".\" )\r\n```\r\nHowever, `simplify_path()` currently assumes that the URI scheme is only alphanumeric; as a result, it currently mangles URI paths if the scheme has a non-alphanumeric character in it.\r\nFor example: `sshfs+f314g23://foo.bar` gets mangled to `sshfs+f314g23:/foo.bar`.\r\n\r\nChanging simplify_path to check for all valid uri characters past the first character fixes this.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https:/